# Branch protection on main uses "Require review from Code Owners"
# with 0 required approving reviews. The last matching pattern wins.
# Content paths are listed after `*` with no owners, so a pull request
# that only changes jobs/, talents/, or companies/ needs no review.
# Anything else needs approval from the Softprobe team.
# The checker also treats @zwobill as a maintainer when this team entry
# is missing.

* @softprobe/openjob-maintainers
/jobs/
/talents/
/companies/
